==English==
Reconciliation is the process in which two romantic couple decides to stay friends for the rest of their lives. It doesn't have to be a romantic couple to reconcile. It can be BF (best friend) or BFF (best friend forever) or even enemies.
===Verb===
To be reconciled is to pursade.
head|en|verb form}}

Some people can be reconciled with objects also.

